    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Screen Talk: Cynthia Erivo"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "As she prepares to unveil her mesmerising performance in Prima Facie, we welcome Cynthia Erivo to this Screen Talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/debut-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Debut"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For LFF 2026’s curtain call, writer-director Jesse Eisenberg delivers a rapturous and raucously funny love letter to community theatre, featuring a luminous lead performance by Julianne Moore."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/frank-and-percy-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Frank and Percy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Roger Allam and Ian McKellen excel as the titular characters in this adaptation of the West End hit, about finding connection beyond your sixties."
    }
  ]
